@gatewayUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Creer un cours (10 places, 25 EUR)
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/classes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Yoga Vinyasa",
  "description": "Enchainement fluide de postures pour tous",
  "instructor": "Marie Dupont",
  "gymLocation": "Paris",
  "category": "YOGA",
  "level": "BEGINNER",
  "durationMinutes": 60,
  "maxParticipants": 10,
  "price": 25.00,
  "dateTime": "2026-10-15T18:30:00"
}

### Lister les cours (pagination)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/classes?page=0&size=10&sort=dateTime,asc

### Filtrer par categorie et niveau
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/classes?category=YOGA&level=BEGINNER

### Rechercher par date / localisation
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/classes/search?dateFrom=2026-10-01&dateTo=2026-10-31&location=Paris

### Details d'un cours (remplacer l'id)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/classes/1

### 2. Reserver 2 places -> 201 PENDING_PAYMENT
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "userEmail": "john@example.com",
  "userName": "John Doe",
  "classId": 1,
  "numberOfSpots": 2
}

### Verifier la reservation (remplacer l'id)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/bookings/1

### 3. Payer -> 200 CONFIRMED (2 x 25 = 50 EUR < 100 EUR : accepte)
PATCH {{gatewayUrl}}/api/bookings/1/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentMethod": "CREDIT_CARD",
  "cardLastFour": "1234",
  "transactionId": "txn_123456"
}

### Paiement de la reservation
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/payments/booking/1

### 4. Annuler (dans les delais) -> 200 CANCELLED + remboursement
PATCH {{gatewayUrl}}/api/bookings/1/cancel

### Verifier le remboursement -> status REFUNDED
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/payments/booking/1

### Verifier les places liberees
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/classes/1

### Historique des notifications de l'utilisateur
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/notifications/user/1

### 5. Erreur : surreservation (4 places sur un cours quasi plein) -> 409
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 2,
  "userEmail": "alice@example.com",
  "userName": "Alice",
  "classId": 1,
  "numberOfSpots": 4
}

### 5. Erreur : paiement refuse (4 x 60 EUR = 240 EUR >= 100 EUR) -> 402
# Reserver d'abord 4 places sur le cours "Spinning Endurance" (id 5 du jeu de donnees)
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 3,
  "userEmail": "bob@example.com",
  "userName": "Bob",
  "classId": 5,
  "numberOfSpots": 4
}

### Reservations en attente expirees (scheduler)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/bookings/expired

### Notifications en attente / echouees
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/notifications/pending
